&gt; If he wants to understand the world, then getting shin deep in conflict to learn a thing or two might be motivation. 

&amp;#x200B;

&gt; He doesn't need to care about the problem, just himself in order to do something. 

&amp;#x200B;

These two lines form an almost "or" dilemma in my head and I like the direction it's going. With such a conflict, I think I could shrink it down to either self preservation or greater knowledge. What you've wrote has really given me quite a lot to think about.
